# AI core rules for Shadowrocket / 2026-11-01
# Personal routing snapshot, not an upstream release. No proxy policy in RULE-SET file.
# Selected third-party login/subscription/diagnostic hosts are in AI-Dependencies.list.
# No entire googleapis.com / facebook.com / livekit.cloud / shared cloud-provider suffixes.
# Includes MIT-licensed v2fly/domain-list-community data; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.

# OpenAI / ChatGPT / Codex / Sora
# Source: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9247338-network-recommendations-for-chatgpt-errors-on-web-and-apps ; https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iab0x00/ProxyRules/main/Rule/AI.txt
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com

